buaa-netlogin

This project is a modified version of pySrun4k_BeihangLogin:
https://github.com/ywz978020607/pySrun4k_BeihangLogin

The original project is distributed under the GNU General Public License
version 3. This modified version keeps the same license. See LICENSE for
the full license text.

Major changes in this version:
- Added a modern Srun challenge-based login loop.
- Consolidated all user actions into one interactive entry point.
- Removed the legacy protocol implementation and Docker deployment.
- Enabled TLS certificate verification by default.
- Added a friendly multi-level arrow-key terminal interface.
- Added a boot-time system service with root-only stored credentials.
- Uses systemd credentials and a sandboxed dynamic user when supported.
- Added offline protocol, configuration, and service tests.
- Added transactional service installation with automatic rollback.
- Added expired-challenge retry and fixed-vector protocol tests.
- Added secure macOS boot-time support using a system LaunchDaemon and
  service-user-only credentials, without exposing secrets in plist or arguments.
